# e2e/cr-combat-clip.spec.ts — a crowded battlefield at declare attackers.
# Seat 0 (human) in an uncontested Main Phase 1 of its own turn with sixteen different untapped,
# non-sick creatures (distinct names, so none of them piles) and five lands: the front tier is
# creatures from its first column to its last, and the spec drags one into the back tier, so a
# creature that can attack sits on every edge of the battlefield.
# Seat 1 (ai) has nothing, so nothing blocks and nothing answers.
